  "idea": "Automated timezone meeting scheduler that finds fair overlapping hours",
  "text": "This clever tool calculates the fairest overlapping meeting hours with zero painful timezone math. Distributed teams waste dozens of emails back and forth trying to convert daylight saving time differences. When managers pick meeting slots arbitrarily, remote teammates in opposite hemispheres suffer chronic schedule burnout. Deploy Timezone.io or World Time Buddy to identify mutual working hours and rotate monthly sync times. This eliminates scheduling friction across global teams.",
